T98	Quotation 48963 48978	"Be satisfied,"
T99	Cue 48979 48983	said
T100	Entity 48984 48986	he
T101	Quotation 48988 49296	"I will not raise any outcry.  I will keep my ill-humour to myself.  I have a very sincere interest in Emma. Isabella does not seem more my sister; has never excited a greater interest; perhaps hardly so great.  There is an anxiety, a curiosity in what one feels for Emma.  I wonder what will become of her!"
